Third-party software
--------------------
The desktop application bundles third-party components under their own
licenses, including Tauri (MIT OR Apache-2.0), React and React DOM (MIT), React
Flow / @xyflow (MIT), Tiptap and ProseMirror (MIT), d3 modules (ISC,
BSD-3-Clause), and zustand (MIT), plus the Rust crates listed in Cargo.lock
(audited with `cargo deny check`; allowed licenses in deny.toml). The executable
also contains Microsoft's Edge WebView2 loader (WebView2LoaderStatic.lib from
the Microsoft Edge WebView2 SDK, linked by the webview2-com-sys crate), under
Microsoft's BSD-style license. The complete
list with license texts is THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which every installer ships
next to the program. The JavaScript audit is `pnpm run audit:licenses`.

Assets
------
The application icon (assets/brand/ and the generated src-tauri/icons/*) is an
original work created for this project; see docs/brand/ASSETS.md for its
attribution and license record. No fonts are bundled; the UI uses the operating
system's fonts.
